    <header><p class="kicker">Privacy</p><h1>Rinklet — Privacy</h1></header>
    <div class="guide-body">
      <p>Effective date: 9 October 2026</p>
      <p>This policy covers the Rinklet app for iPhone and iPad. Contact: <a href="mailto:podpora@zeleznalady.cz">podpora@zeleznalady.cz</a>.</p>
      <h2>Local play and storage</h2>
      <p>The computer, local two-player and practice modes work without an account or internet connection. Rinklet stores your settings, unfinished local match and basic match counts in the app’s storage on your device. The app does not send those files to servers operated by the developer. Device backups are managed separately by the operating system and your backup settings.</p>
      <h2>Online play through Game Center</h2>
      <p>Online duels use Apple’s Game Center for sign-in, matchmaking and communication between two players. During a match, Rinklet temporarily uses Game Center player identifiers to assign player roles and check incoming gameplay messages. The app does not save those identifiers in local match files or developer logs. Gameplay positions, mallet targets, scores and match state are exchanged through Game Center so that the two players see the same match. Rinklet has no developer-operated account or gameplay server.</p>
      <p>Apple processes Game Center account and activity information according to its own policy: <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/game-center/">https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/game-center/</a>. Game Center privacy and parental settings are managed in your device’s system settings. Local modes remain available without signing in to Game Center.</p>
      <h2>Motion, audio and haptics</h2>
      <p>If tilt-responsive shadows are enabled, Rinklet reads device gravity samples locally to adjust lighting during active play. These samples are not stored, logged or transmitted. You can turn the effect off in Rinklet Settings; the app also respects the device’s Reduce Motion setting. The app plays sound and optional haptic feedback. It does not record audio or request microphone, camera, location or contacts access.</p>
      <h2>Advertising and analytics</h2>
      <p>Rinklet contains no advertising, analytics SDK, tracking or in-app purchases. The developer does not use Rinklet to build advertising profiles or track activity across apps or websites.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can change language, sound, haptics, effects and tilt-responsive shadows in the app. Settings and unfinished local matches are stored on the device. Removing the app also removes its local app storage; operating-system backups are controlled separately by your device settings.</p>
      <h2>Support correspondence</h2>
      <p>If you email <a href="mailto:podpora@zeleznalady.cz">podpora@zeleznalady.cz</a>, we use the address and information you voluntarily provide to respond to your request. Support correspondence is kept for no longer than 90 days. Please do not send passwords or other unnecessary sensitive information.</p>
      <h2>Changes and scope</h2>
      <p>This policy will be updated if Rinklet’s data practices change. It applies to the app; the website hosting this page may have its own website privacy information. For questions about Rinklet’s privacy, email <a href="mailto:podpora@zeleznalady.cz">podpora@zeleznalady.cz</a>.</p>
      <p><a href="/en/apps/rinklet/">Game features</a> · <a href="/en/support/rinklet/">Rinklet support</a> · <a href="/en/privacy/">VCode website privacy</a></p>
